Aapko employee name aur uske department ka naam chahiye.
Maan lete hain department_ids ek single department id hai (agar multiple hain to relation alag hoga).

SQL Query:

SELECT e.name, d.dept_name
FROM Employees e
JOIN Departments d
ON e.department_ids = d.department_id;



if ids coma , separate

1.
SELECT e.name, d.dept_name
FROM Employees e
JOIN Departments d
ON FIND_IN_SET(d.department_id, e.department_ids);


2.
SELECT e.name AS employee_name,
       d.dept_name AS department_name
FROM Employees e
JOIN Departments d
  ON FIND_IN_SET(d.department_id, e.department_ids) > 0;

3.
Using STRING_SPLIT

SELECT e.name, d.dept_name
FROM Employees e
JOIN STRING_SPLIT(e.department_ids, ',') s
JOIN Departments d ON d.department_id = s.value;